cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "PRISM-GEP: Viewing Single-Cell Expression through the Lens of Topic Modeling"
abstract: >-
  PRISM-GEP recovers gene-expression programs from single-cell RNA-seq by treating
  the problem as topic modeling. It runs standard LDA (a patched MALLET) with an
  informed, per-gene Dirichlet prior estimated from the dataset's own gene-gene
  co-expression geometry, with no external database or reference atlas. This
  repository holds the method, the evaluation code, and the generators for the
  paper's benchmark tables.
